<div class="identity">
  <h3>There's More Than One Way to Build Something</h3>
  <p><span class="cap">Important names are capitalized</span> — and you are an important person. You don't need a loan and a big building to be a real entrepreneur. You don't need to start big at all. Rock'N Outlaw started with flowers. The moccasin maker started with skilled hands and one good relationship. Tomorrow we slow down and get fast and accurate with everything we've learned so far.</p>
