<h2 class="section">0:00–8:00 · Login &amp; Typing Practice</h2>
<p>Standard routine.</p>

<h2 class="section">8:00–11:00 · Choral Recall</h2>
<div class="script">
  <p class="t">Quick fire round. Entrepreneur?</p>
  <p class="cr">"Takes on the risk, keeps the reward or the loss."</p>
  <p class="t">Key Resources?</p>
  <p class="cr">"Skills. And who you know."</p>
  <p class="t">Key Activities?</p>
