</table>

<div class="identity">
  <h3>Value Isn't Given — It's Recognized</h3>
  <p><span class="cap">Important names are capitalized</span> — and you are an important person. A shell became money because people agreed it mattered. Your skills work the same way. Nobody hands you your value — you already have it. Tomorrow we start putting these skills to work.</p>
