  <p><span class="cap">Important names are capitalized</span> — and you are an important person. What you wrote today isn't a school assignment you'll forget. It's proof — in your own words — of who you already are. It stays in your workbook, and in five weeks, it becomes the opening of your own pitch.</p>
</div>

